      <description>&lt;p&gt;Accounts available for inspection at &lt;strong&gt;Oakley surgery&lt;/strong&gt; from Monday 15 June (also Overton and Kingsclere — those sites out of Oakley scope). Inspection window runs until the Friends AGM on &lt;strong&gt;29 June&lt;/strong&gt; (Overton — separate notice, not calendarled here). Contact Chair Sue Berry 01256 770565 or Secretary Sue Carter 01256 770681.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
